{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #fffdf2; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(transparent 0,transparent 31px,#829db529 31px,#829db529 32px); background-size: 100% 32px; border-left: 1px solid #a13a37; box-sizing: border-box; color: #303a45; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 24px 26px 32px 40px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #303a45; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"border: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid #303a45; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 0 26px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 0 24px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #303a45; display: block; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; text-align: left; width: auto\"\u003e铺开熟悉的米白横线练习簿，细微的纸纹与红色页边线让思考像提笔落纸一样舒展从容。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 0 0 auto; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; text-align: left; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg\" alt=\"书桌上的摊开笔记与温热咖啡\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 28px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 12px 0 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #a13a37; display: block; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0 0 8px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e在安静的横线间建立阅读节奏\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #303a45; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 16px\"\u003e砖红章节标题温和清晰，克制留白与斜体引语取代刺眼色块，长文久读不累眼。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px dashed #a13a37; color: #303a45; font-size: 18px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.85; margin: 24px 0; padding: 16px 0; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e写下来的思考，才会真正沉淀成自己的东西。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 28px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 12px 0 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #a13a37; display: block; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0 0 8px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e适合练习簿风的日常题材\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e温润淡米横线纸纹克制不抢正文\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e细红页边线与虚线分隔还原真实纸本手感\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e适配读书笔记、学习复盘与生活手记\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #596c7e; color: #303a45; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e翻过这一页，明天继续安静而笃定地记录。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
